Z||000000||lou_dias||10-13-2001||06:13 PM||||He did hit it though.<BR>I just parked my 88GT in front of my house.<BR>I look and 4 houses down a truck was crossing at a stop sign towards me. I open my door 6" and I grab my wallet and then I start to open and put my foot out and I say that truck is awful big, fast and close to my side with noone coming from the other side and I dip my foot back in and start to close the door when WHAM.<BR>I'm holding the door and hit my head on the side that holds the windshield then as the front of my car getts forced to the sidewalk, I get slammed back.<P>Bent the right front wheel on the sidewalk, door is totalled and won't close.  Does that mean frame damage???  Left front fender is pretty bad too.<P>If it is frame damage, I will strip it and put the good parts into my 87 gt and sell the rest.||||reg||1
